WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.033
Everything on Guide.

00:00:02.733 --> 00:00:10.867
The Guide. How it all fits together: the path of a job, how to do the everyday things, and what each part of the menu is for.

00:00:11.367 --> 00:00:16.667
Quick tour of the app. Plays a short tour of the main screens, one after another.

00:00:17.167 --> 00:00:22.167
The path of a job. From the first call to the commission, in nine steps.

00:00:22.667 --> 00:00:30.233
Each step opens its screen. Click a step, like 1 · A call or a request, to open the screen where it happens.

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:37.367
Crew on site. This one happens on the crew's phone. It opens the Schedule, where you see who is where.

00:00:37.867 --> 00:00:43.767
How to …. The everyday jobs, step by step. The bold words are the buttons to press.

00:00:44.267 --> 00:00:49.267
An open how-to. Numbered steps, with who usually does it under the title.

00:00:49.767 --> 00:00:55.833
Take the tour. Plays that how-to on the real screens, pointing at each button, like this tour.

00:00:56.333 --> 00:00:59.600
Show me. Just opens the screen where it happens.

00:01:00.100 --> 00:01:05.367
Open another. Click a title to open it; the one that was open closes.

00:01:05.867 --> 00:01:09.733
Now open. Its steps, and its own Take the tour.

00:01:10.233 --> 00:01:15.600
Where things are. Every part of the menu, what it's for and how often you'll use it.

00:01:16.100 --> 00:01:20.567
Sell. My day, Customers, Appointments, Estimates and Marketing.

00:01:21.067 --> 00:01:25.933
Build. Jobs, Schedule, Maintenance, Deliveries, Snow and Timesheets.

00:01:26.433 --> 00:01:30.700
Money. Invoices and Reports, for people who see money.

00:01:31.200 --> 00:01:37.667
Setup. Catalogue, Fleet and, for the owner and office, Team & crews, Automations and Settings.

00:01:38.167 --> 00:01:44.133
Open a screen. Click a row to open that screen. The tag says how often it's used.

00:01:44.633 --> 00:01:51.400
Help on every screen. Ask in your own words, or pick "Show me everything on this screen" for a tour like this one.

00:01:51.900 --> 00:02:01.067
Search. Finds customers, phones, streets and EST-, JOB- or INV- numbers from any screen (⌘K).

00:02:01.533 --> 00:02:07.133
That's it. You can play this tour in the app any time: press Help, and ask in your own words.
